      <div class="left">
        <span class="eyebrow asm-fade"><svg class="iris-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>What we do</span>
        <h2 class="h2 asm-fade">Choose the practice that fits your problem.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="muted asm-fade" style="max-width:34ch">Three practices, each for a different kind of buyer. Start with the one that matches what you need.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="svc-grid asm-stage">
      <a class="svc asm-card" href="partnerships">
        <svg class="iris-ico" viewBox="0 0 54 54" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="14" cy="27" r="9" pathLength="200"/><circle class="fillgold" cx="14" cy="27" r="3" stroke="none"/><circle cx="40" cy="27" r="9" pathLength="200"/><circle class="fillgold" cx="40" cy="27" r="3" stroke="none"/><path d="M24 27h6" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="200"/></svg>
        <h3 class="h3">B2B Partnerships</h3>
        <p class="svc-buyer">For international firms entering the US. Channel strategy and partner introductions for companies new to the American market.</p>
        <ul class="svc-names">
          <li>US Market Entry Research</li>
          <li>Channel Strategy &amp; Enablement</li>
          <li>B2B Partner Introductions</li>
          <li>Regional Expansion · Canada &amp; LATAM</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="svc-arrow">Explore<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="svc asm-card" href="ai-solutions">
        <svg class="iris-ico" viewBox="0 0 54 54" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="27" cy="27" r="22" pathLength="200"/><circle cx="27" cy="27" r="12" pathLength="200"/><circle class="fillgold" cx="27" cy="27" r="3.6" stroke="none"/><path d="M27 2v8M27 44v8M2 27h8M44 27h8" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="200"/></svg>
        <h3 class="h3">AI Solutions Development</h3>
        <p class="svc-buyer">For teams that need AI built. Custom applications, workflow automation and operational efficiency.</p>
        <ul class="svc-names">
          <li>Custom Applications</li>
          <li>Workflow Automation</li>
          <li>Operational Efficiency</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="svc-arrow">Explore<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="svc asm-card" href="digital-presence">
        <svg class="iris-ico" viewBox="0 0 54 54" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle class="fillgold" cx="16" cy="27" r="3.6" stroke="none"/><circle cx="16" cy="27" r="9" pathLength="200"/><path d="M30 14a19 19 0 0 1 0 26M38 9a27 27 0 0 1 0 36M46 5a35 35 0 0 1 0 44" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="200"/></svg>
        <h3 class="h3">Digital Presence</h3>
        <p class="svc-buyer">For businesses building their presence online. Websites, digital marketing, and community and content.</p>
        <ul class="svc-names">
          <li>Websites</li>
          <li>Digital Marketing</li>
          <li>Community &amp; Content</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="svc-arrow">Explore<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW THE PRACTICES FIT TOGETHER -->
<section class="section surface-alt" id="fit">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fit-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow reveal"><svg class="iris-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>How the practices fit together</span>
        <h2 class="h2 fit-title reveal" data-d="1">Separate practices, one way of working.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-copy reveal" data-d="2">
        <p class="lead">Each practice stands on its own. You can start with one and add another later.</p>
        <p>They share the same way of working: plain advice and clear steps from the first call to the handover.</p>
        <p>Some problems cross the lines. A firm entering the US may also need a website that speaks to American buyers. A team building an application may need clear content to explain it. Tell us about both and we will say how to sequence them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


